# 🚀 **Week 3 – Task 2: Governance Enforcement Flow (Pre-Execution Validation)**

---

## 📌 **Overview**

This module defines the **Governance Enforcement Flow** for validating AI actions **before execution**.

🎯 **Goal:**
Ensure every AI-generated action is:

* ✅ Policy-validated
* ✅ Risk-controlled
* ✅ Compliant

The governance layer acts as a **control checkpoint** that evaluates requests and ensures only **safe and approved actions** are executed.

---

## 🔄 **Governance Enforcement Flow**

```text
User Prompt
    ↓
AI Agent Processing
    ↓
Policy Validation (OPA)
    ↓
Governance Decision (Allow / Deny / Approval Required)
    ↓
Action Execution
    ↓
Audit Logging
```

---

## 🧠 **Flow Explanation**

| Step                  | Description                     |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------- |
| **User Prompt**       | User sends request to AI        |
| **Agent Processing**  | AI interprets intent            |
| **Policy Validation** | Request checked using OPA       |
| **Decision**          | Allow / Deny / Require Approval |
| **Execution**         | Action performed if allowed     |
| **Audit Logging**     | All steps recorded              |

---

## ⚙️ **Policy Validation in Pipeline**

```text
Prompt Input
     ↓
Agent Planning
     ↓
🛑 Pre-Execution Policy Validation
     ↓
Action Execution
     ↓
